<%# One banked lesson in the Insight Bank. Local: grade (a banked ActionGrade). The
    left border + disposition badge read the binary good/not signal; the meta line
    traces it back to whatever it was mined from and whether it is Alex's grade or
    the McRitchie audit of Alex.

    A grade targets EITHER a raw action OR a narrated span (ActionGrade's XOR), so
    read the provenance from whichever is set — a span grade has no atomic_action
    (dereferencing it unconditionally 500'd the whole bank). Both nil means the
    target was deleted (has_many :nullify), so the lesson outlives its source. %>
<% source = grade.insight_source %>
<div class="hb-insight <%= "is-not" if grade.not_good? %>" data-test="insight">
  <div class="hb-isl">
    <span><%= grade.slug %></span>
    <span class="hb-disp <%= grade.good? ? "good" : "not" %>"><%= grade.disposition.upcase %></span>
    <span class="hb-grader"><%= grade.alex? ? "Alex" : "McR → Alex" %></span>
  </div>
  <div class="hb-imeta">
    <% if source %>
      from <%= grade.event_grade? ? "span " : "" %>#<%= source.seq %><%= " &middot; #{grade.insight_label}".html_safe if grade.insight_label.present? %>
      <%= " &middot; #{source.task_slug}".html_safe if source.task_slug.present? %>
    <% else %>
      source since removed
    <% end %>
  </div>
  <% if grade.long_form.present? %>
    <div class="hb-ilg"><%= grade.long_form %></div>
  <% end %>
</div>
